---
layout: base.njk
title: "Sponsoraanvraag | Standaard Boekhandel Putte — ArkAstro"
description: "Vraag sponsoring aan bij Standaard Boekhandel Putte (Arkastro BV) voor jouw evenement of project."
permalink: /sponsoraanvraag.html
activeNav: boeken
---
    <!-- Hero -->
    <header class="bg-marine text-white px-6 py-16 md:py-20 relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="background:
            radial-gradient(1000px 500px at 15% 20%, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.20), transparent 60%),
            radial-gradient(800px 400px at 85% 75%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08), transparent 55%);"></div>
        <div class="container mx-auto relative z-10 max-w-3xl text-center">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gold mb-4">Standaard Boekhandel Putte</p>
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 pb-1 gold-gradient leading-[1.1]">Sponsoraanvraag</h1>
            <p class="text-base md:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto text-gray-200 leading-relaxed">
                Organiseer je een evenement of project en zoek je steun van onze winkel?
                Vul het formulier in — wij bekijken elke aanvraag persoonlijk.
            </p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Form -->
    <section class="py-16 md:py-20 container mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-10 text-center">
                Winkel: <span class="font-semibold text-marine">Standaard Boekhandel Putte</span>
                <span class="text-gray-400">(uitgebaat door Arkastro BV)</span>
            </p>

            <form id="sponsoraanvraag-form" class="space-y-10" novalidate
                  data-api-url="https://mailer.arkastro.be/mail/send">
                <!-- Honeypot: leave empty (hidden from users) -->
                <div class="absolute -left-[9999px] top-auto h-0 w-0 overflow-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
                    <label for="website">Website</label>
                    <input type="text" id="website" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
                </div>

                <!-- 1. Gegevens -->
                <fieldset class="bg-white rounded-3xl border-t-8 border-gold shadow-sm p-8 md:p-10">
                    <legend class="sr-only">Gegevens van de aanvrager</legend>
                    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold mb-2">
                        <span class="text-gold mr-2">1.</span>Gegevens van de aanvrager
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-8">Wie dient deze aanvraag in?</p>

                    <div class="grid gap-6">
                        <div>
                            <label for="organisatie" class="block text-sm font-bold text-marine mb-2">Naam vereniging of organisatie <span class="text-gold">*</span></label>
                            <input type="text" id="organisatie" name="organisatie" required autocomplete="organization"
                                   class="form-input w-full rounded-xl border border-black/10 bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3 text-marine focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold/60 focus:border-gold" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                            <div>
                                <label for="contactpersoon" class="block text-sm font-bold text-marine mb-2">Naam contactpersoon <span class="text-gold">*</span></label>
                                <input type="text" id="contactpersoon" name="contactpersoon" required autocomplete="name"
                                       class="form-input w-full rounded-xl border border-black/10 bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3 text-marine focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold/60 focus:border-gold" />
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <label for="functie" class="block text-sm font-bold text-marine mb-2">Functie</label>
                                <input type="text" id="functie" name="functie" autocomplete="organization-title"
                                       class="form-input w-full rounded-xl border border-black/10 bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3 text-marine focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold/60 focus:border-gold" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                            <div>
                                <label for="telefoon" class="block text-sm font-bold text-marine mb-2">Telefoonnummer <span class="text-gold">*</span></label>
                                <input type="tel" id="telefoon" name="telefoon" required autocomplete="tel"
                                       class="form-input w-full rounded-xl border border-black/10 bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3 text-marine focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold/60 focus:border-gold" />
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <label for="email" class="block text-sm font-bold text-marine mb-2">E-mailadres <span class="text-gold">*</span></label>
                                <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email"
                                       class="form-input w-full rounded-xl border border-black/10 bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3 text-marine focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold/60 focus:border-gold" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </fieldset>

                <!-- 2. Evenement -->
                <fieldset class="bg-white rounded-3xl border-t-8 border-gold shadow-sm p-8 md:p-10">
                    <legend class="sr-only">Details van het evenement</legend>
                    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold mb-2">
                        <span class="text-gold mr-2">2.</span>Details van het evenement
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-8">Indien van toepassing — laat leeg bij een algemene aanvraag.</p>

                    <div class="grid gap-6">
                        <div>
                            <label for="evenement" class="block text-sm font-bold text-marine mb-2">Naam van het evenement / project</label>
                            <input type="text" id="evenement" name="evenement"
                                   class="form-input w-full rounded-xl border border-black/10 bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3 text-marine focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold/60 focus:border-gold" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                            <div>
                                <label for="datum-evenement" class="block text-sm font-bold text-marine mb-2">Datum van het evenement</label>
                                <input type="date" id="datum-evenement" name="datum-evenement"
                                       class="form-input w-full rounded-xl border border-black/10 bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3 text-marine focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold/60 focus:border-gold" />
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <label for="deelnemers" class="block text-sm font-bold text-marine mb-2">Verwacht aantal deelnemers / bezoekers</label>
                                <input type="number" id="deelnemers" name="deelnemers" min="1" inputmode="numeric"
                                       class="form-input w-full rounded-xl border border-black/10 bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3 text-marine focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold/60 focus:border-gold" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label for="locatie" class="block text-sm font-bold text-marine mb-2">Locatie</label>
                            <input type="text" id="locatie" name="locatie" autocomplete="address-level2"
                                   class="form-input w-full rounded-xl border border-black/10 bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3 text-marine focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold/60 focus:border-gold" />
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </fieldset>

                <!-- 3. Sponsoring -->
                <fieldset class="bg-white rounded-3xl border-t-8 border-gold shadow-sm p-8 md:p-10">
                    <legend class="sr-only">Gevraagde sponsoring</legend>
                    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold mb-2">
                        <span class="text-gold mr-2">3.</span>Gevraagde sponsoring
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-8">Wat vraag je precies aan?</p>

                    <div class="grid gap-6">
                        <div>
                            <label for="bedrag" class="block text-sm font-bold text-marine mb-2">Gevraagd bedrag (in euro)</label>
                            <div class="relative">
                                <span class="absolute left-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-gray-400 font-semibold" aria-hidden="true">€</span>
                                <input type="number" id="bedrag" name="bedrag" min="0" step="0.01" inputmode="decimal"
                                       class="form-input w-full rounded-xl border border-black/10 bg-gray-50 pl-10 pr-4 py-3 text-marine focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold/60 focus:border-gold" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label for="goederen" class="block text-sm font-bold text-marine mb-2">Of gevraagde goederen</label>
                            <input type="text" id="goederen" name="goederen" placeholder="bijv. waardebonnen, boeken, prijzen"
                                   class="form-input w-full rounded-xl border border-black/10 bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3 text-marine focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold/60 focus:border-gold placeholder:text-gray-400" />
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label for="andere-vragen" class="block text-sm font-bold text-marine mb-2">Andere vragen</label>
                            <textarea id="andere-vragen" name="andere-vragen" rows="3"
                                      class="form-input w-full rounded-xl border border-black/10 bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3 text-marine focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold/60 focus:border-gold resize-y"></textarea>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </fieldset>

                <!-- 4. Tegenprestatie -->
                <fieldset class="bg-white rounded-3xl border-t-8 border-gold shadow-sm p-8 md:p-10">
                    <legend class="sr-only">Tegenprestatie / visibiliteit</legend>
                    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold mb-2">
                        <span class="text-gold mr-2">4.</span>Tegenprestatie (visibiliteit)
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-8">
                        Wat krijgt Standaard Boekhandel Putte in ruil? Denk aan logo op affiche/flyer, vermelding op sociale media, advertentie in een programmaboekje, banner, enz.
                    </p>

                    <div>
                        <label for="tegenprestatie" class="block text-sm font-bold text-marine mb-2">Gedetailleerde beschrijving van de tegenprestatie <span class="text-gold">*</span></label>
                        <textarea id="tegenprestatie" name="tegenprestatie" rows="5" required
                                  class="form-input w-full rounded-xl border border-black/10 bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3 text-marine focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold/60 focus:border-gold resize-y"></textarea>
                    </div>
                </fieldset>

                <div id="form-status" class="hidden rounded-2xl px-5 py-4 text-sm font-medium" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>

                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 sm:items-center sm:justify-between pt-2">
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">
                        Velden met <span class="text-gold font-bold">*</span> zijn verplicht.
                        Je aanvraag wordt per e-mail doorgestuurd naar Standaard Boekhandel Putte.
                    </p>
                    <button type="submit" id="sponsor-submit"
                            class="bg-marine text-white font-bold py-4 px-10 rounded-full hover:bg-marine/90 transition duration-300 shadow-xl inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap disabled:opacity-60 disabled:cursor-not-allowed">
                        <span class="submit-label">Verstuur aanvraag</span>
                        <span class="ml-2 submit-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </section>
